BLAKE            2850      34200                                                                    
CLARK            2450      29400                                                                    
SCOTT            3000      36000                                                                    
KING             5000      60000                                                                    
TURNER           1500      18000                                                                    
ADAMS            1100      13200                                                                    
FORD             3000      36000                                                                    
MILLER           1300      15600                                                                    

